        "body": "<p><strong>We believe that eczema, dermatitis and sensitive skin sufferers are different.</strong></p><p>We're mindful that they may be more susceptible to irritation from certain ingredients in everyday skincare products. Many cosmetics and cleansers are fine for most people, but if you have eczema, dermatitis or reactive skin, labels such as \"hypoallergenic\" or \"sensitive\" don't guarantee that a product will be suitable for you.</p><p>If a dermatologist or allergist has performed patch testing, you may already know which ingredients cause allergic reactions. If you’re unsure, we’ve listed some potential irritants and allergens to watch for below.</p>",
